{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e02-scene-17",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "决定留在星天  (Choosing to Stay at Xingtian)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "lin_jie": "林姐",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "On the busy studio floor, Lin Jie reminds exhausted Bu Xiaogu that she still has gentler career options, prompting Xiaogu to phone Professor Fang with her final answer on DTS. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "这边的灯光位置都调好了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "调好了，林姐。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "我听说你是传媒学院的好学生。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "节目制作可是非常苦的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "这不比坐办公室那么舒服。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "其实你现在还有机会选。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "要是觉得太累，别勉强自己。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢林姐，我想清楚了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，方老师，不好意思，我的论文要晚交了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "关于电视台那份工作，我已经决定了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我要留在星天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "就算从现场组做起，我也要做下去。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "这边的灯光位置都调好了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are the lighting positions over here all adjusted?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "调好了，林姐。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They are all adjusted, Lin Jie.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "我听说你是传媒学院的好学生。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I heard you are a strong student from Media College.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "节目制作可是非常苦的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Show production is really tough work.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "这不比坐办公室那么舒服。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This does not compare to sitting comfortably in an office.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "其实你现在还有机会选。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Actually you still have a chance to choose right now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "要是觉得太累，别勉强自己。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If it feels too tiring, do not force yourself.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "谢谢林姐，我想清楚了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you, Lin Jie, I have thought it through clearly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，方老师，不好意思，我的论文要晚交了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, Professor Fang, sorry, I will hand in my thesis late.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "关于电视台那份工作，我已经决定了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Regarding that job at the television network, I have decided already.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我要留在星天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I want to stay at Xingtian.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "就算从现场组做起，我也要做下去。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even starting from the floor crew, I will keep doing it.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "lin_jie",
      "t": "这边的灯光位置都调好了吗？",
